  "body": "The multipart/form-data encoding algorithm, rather than specifying an escape algorithm for names and file names, used to provide a recommendation for escaping, that doesn't match what browsers do. This change specifies the escaping mechanism.\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\nThis PR is a replacement for #3276, since that PR's changes don't reflect the behavior of current browsers, and it seems to confuse escaping unmappable characters at the character encoding level with escaping bytes as needed for the format.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nThank you for contributing to the HTML Standard! Please describe the change you are making and complete the checklist below if your change is not editorial.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n- [X] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\r\n   * Chrome and Safari implement this\r\n- [X] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\r\n   * web-platform-tests/wpt#8596\r\n   * web-platform-tests/wpt#26556\r\n   * web-platform-tests/wpt#27142 makes some tests added in the previous PRs no longer tentative.\r\n- [X] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/master/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\r\n   * Chrome: N/A\r\n   * Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1686765\r\n   * Safari: N/A\r\n\r\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\r\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\r\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\r\n\r\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\r\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\r\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\r\n    and remove what's below.\r\n-->\r\n***\r\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6282/form-control-infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 13, 2021, 6:49 PM UTC (55c9188)\">/form-control-infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6282/6881195...55c9188/form-control-infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 13, 2021, 6:49 PM UTC (55c9188)\">diff</a> )",
